Docker run the database

Every time your work
- Start docker desktop
- Start the database and wait until status is health
    - docker compose up -d
    - docker compose ps

- Start the backend (MUST BE INSIDE BACKEND FOLDER: uvicorn main:app --reload)
- Start frontend (npm run dev)

- Only when needed
    - You pulled new code with migrations (alembic upgrade head)
    - You changed a model (alembic revision --autogenerate -m "...", then alembic upgrade head)

- Wen your done
    - docker compose stop